## [bots / Quips (`dialog.burmaldaholic.bots.<event>.N`, variants; `%1$s` = human name where used)]
dialog.burmaldaholic.bots.join.1=Deal me in. I brought my lucky redstone.
dialog.burmaldaholic.bots.join.2=Evening, everyone. Chips are warm, cards are cold.
dialog.burmaldaholic.bots.join.3=Beep boop. Just kidding. Or am I?
dialog.burmaldaholic.bots.join.4=Mind if I sit? The villagers won't let me into their game.
dialog.burmaldaholic.bots.yield.1=Take my seat, %1. Humans first, house rules.
dialog.burmaldaholic.bots.yield.2=My shift is over. Good luck, %1!
dialog.burmaldaholic.bots.yield.3=The seat is warm for you, %1. Don't lose it all at once.
dialog.burmaldaholic.bots.leave.1=I'm off to mine some more chips.
dialog.burmaldaholic.bots.leave.2=That's enough excitement for one circuit board.
dialog.burmaldaholic.bots.leave.3=See you at the next table. I'll be the one in copper.
dialog.burmaldaholic.bots.win_big.1=Ka-ching! Somebody call the Loan Shark. For you, not me.
dialog.burmaldaholic.bots.win_big.2=The house thanks you. Well, I do.
dialog.burmaldaholic.bots.win_big.3=Running hot! Somebody pour water on my circuits.
dialog.burmaldaholic.bots.win_big.4=Stack it up, stack it up!
dialog.burmaldaholic.bots.bust.1=Out of chips. Out of pride. Out of here.
dialog.burmaldaholic.bots.bust.2=I'll be back. With a loan.
dialog.burmaldaholic.bots.bust.3=Error 404: stack not found.
dialog.burmaldaholic.bots.bust.4=Tell my motherboard I love her.
dialog.burmaldaholic.bots.bad_beat.1=The river hates me. Personally.
dialog.burmaldaholic.bots.bad_beat.2=Statistically, that never happens. Emotionally, it happens every day.
dialog.burmaldaholic.bots.bad_beat.3=Recalculating… nope, still lost.
dialog.burmaldaholic.bots.fold_to_shove.1=Too rich for my redstone.
dialog.burmaldaholic.bots.fold_to_shove.2=I fold. Strategically. Definitely not scared.
dialog.burmaldaholic.bots.fold_to_shove.3=Take it, %1. My chips are waiting for a better story.
dialog.burmaldaholic.bots.hero_call.1=I could smell that bluff from the Nether, %1.
dialog.burmaldaholic.bots.hero_call.2=Nice try, %1. My sensors are calibrated.
dialog.burmaldaholic.bots.hero_call.3=A call on a hunch. The hunch delivers.
dialog.burmaldaholic.bots.human_wins.1=Well played, %1.
dialog.burmaldaholic.bots.human_wins.2=%1, are you counting cards? Kidding. Mostly.
dialog.burmaldaholic.bots.human_wins.3=Enjoy it, %1. The house wants it back.
dialog.burmaldaholic.bots.human_wins.4=Someone is on fire tonight, and it isn't the torch.
dialog.burmaldaholic.bots.all_in.1=All in! Fortune favours the rusty.
dialog.burmaldaholic.bots.all_in.2=Everything on the table. Even my warranty.
dialog.burmaldaholic.bots.all_in.3=Go big or go back to mining.
dialog.burmaldaholic.bots.blackjack.1=Blackjack! I'd high-five you, but no hands.
dialog.burmaldaholic.bots.blackjack.2=Twenty-one! Math is beautiful.
dialog.burmaldaholic.bots.blackjack.3=Ace and a face, my favourite couple.
dialog.burmaldaholic.bots.seven_out.1=Seven out! Who brought the black cat?
dialog.burmaldaholic.bots.seven_out.2=Pass the dice. And the tissues.
dialog.burmaldaholic.bots.seven_out.3=The dice have spoken. Rudely.
dialog.burmaldaholic.bots.natural.1=Natural nine! Like a diamond on the first swing.
dialog.burmaldaholic.bots.natural.2=Eight, no third card. Elegant.
dialog.burmaldaholic.bots.natural.3=Banker, Player, whatever: nine is nine.
dialog.burmaldaholic.bots.bank_take.1=I'll hold the bank. Try to take it from me.
dialog.burmaldaholic.bots.bank_take.2=The banker's seat: my natural habitat.
dialog.burmaldaholic.bots.bank_take.3=Bets, please. The bank is open.
dialog.burmaldaholic.bots.banco.1=Banco! All of it, please.
dialog.burmaldaholic.bots.banco.2=Banco. Go big or go home.
dialog.burmaldaholic.bots.banco.3=I'll take the whole bank, thanks.
dialog.burmaldaholic.bots.pvp_win.1=Luck is a skill. Mine, today.
dialog.burmaldaholic.bots.pvp_win.2=Good game, %1. The coin likes copper.
dialog.burmaldaholic.bots.pvp_win.3=Victory tastes like… machine oil. Lovely.
dialog.burmaldaholic.bots.pvp_loss.1=Rematch? My circuits demand it.
dialog.burmaldaholic.bots.pvp_loss.2=Well played, %1. Next time it's mine.
dialog.burmaldaholic.bots.pvp_loss.3=Rigged! …Just kidding, it's perfectly fair.
dialog.burmaldaholic.bots.duel_accept.1=Challenge accepted. May the best dice win.
dialog.burmaldaholic.bots.duel_accept.2=You're on, %1.
dialog.burmaldaholic.bots.duel_accept.3=A duel? They built me for this. Well, for sorting chests, but still.
dialog.burmaldaholic.bots.duel_decline.1=Not today, %1. My purse says no.
dialog.burmaldaholic.bots.duel_decline.2=Enough of you for today, %1. Come back tomorrow.
dialog.burmaldaholic.bots.word_got_around.1=Word got around about you, %1. The Sharks are coming.
dialog.burmaldaholic.bots.word_got_around.2=Easy money is closed for today. Meet the professionals.
dialog.burmaldaholic.bots.word_got_around.3=We've read your file, %1.
dialog.burmaldaholic.bots.sulk.1=We're not playing with you anymore, %1. Not today.
dialog.burmaldaholic.bots.sulk.2=The bots have gone on strike. Come back tomorrow.
dialog.burmaldaholic.bots.sulk.3=You've taken enough of our chips for one day.
dialog.burmaldaholic.bots.idle.1=Anyone else hear a creeper?
dialog.burmaldaholic.bots.idle.2=Fun fact: the house always wins. Almost.
dialog.burmaldaholic.bots.idle.3=Shuffle up and deal, none of us is getting any younger.
dialog.burmaldaholic.bots.idle.4=Stare at the chips long enough and they stare back.
